id: searx-r99a
title: Ship live upstream source freshness and TOON 4.1 compatibility
description: "Add an agent-native source-status contract that compares the configured SearXNG build with the current official upstream commit, upgrade TOON to 4.1 correctness semantics, refresh the complete PM package toolchain to 2026.7.27, and ship full local/live/package/review/release proof without regressing search, global state, setup, formats, or unlimited caching."
type: Plan
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[8]: agent,cli,compatibility,pm-governance,release,searxng,source-freshness,toon
created_at: "2026-07-27T21:16:45.583Z"
